From 3b8269f9c0f6568d092cd616b008bc6c63af86b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:22:01 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 12/25] kcm_notifications: Do Not Disturb first, low priority
 in its own section, application lists read after the first frame
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Page type: Form with List sub-pages (docs/page-design.md section 1). All KConfigXT keys (plasmanotifyrc, DoNotDisturb, per
application/event settings), the global shortcut handling, sound playback and the sub-pages' content are unchanged. NOT BUILT
YET (owner stopped heavy work); checked statically only.

Moved / renamed (wording of every control unchanged, so no new aliases needed):
- The first section is untitled and holds Do Not Disturb: the three automatic conditions, the toggle shortcut, and
  "Critical notifications: Show in Do Not Disturb mode" (was under "Visibility conditions", which is gone).
- "Popups" keeps Location / Hide after / timeout indicator; "Low priority" is a new section for the two low-priority
  checkboxes (were under Visibility conditions); "Additional feedback" -> "Progress and badges".
- "Configure for System…" and "Configure for Applications…" stay page actions top right (they open the per-application
  master-detail sub-page SourcesPage.qml, unchanged apart from a busy indicator); they are disabled until the lists are read.
- Relabel table: inventory/relabel/kcm_notifications.tsv (outer repo). Inventory --strict: 0 lost for this KCM.
  HIG ids: HIG-001, HIG-005, HIG-006, HIG-057; page-design sections 2, 3.

Speed (cause found in code, not measured):
- KCMNotifications::load() did all of this before the page existed: SourcesModel::load() (KFileUtils::findAllUniqueFiles
  over every notifyrc search path, a KApplicationTrader::query over all services, plasmanotifyrc reads), one
  BehaviorSettings (own KConfig group) per application and service, SourcesModel::loadEvents() (reads every event group of
  every notifyrc), loadBehaviorSettings(), and a blocking KGlobalAccel::globalShortcut() D-Bus lookup. Now the main page's
  own settings load as before and the rest is loadSources(), queued one event-loop turn later (generation counter, new
  property sourcesLoaded). A deep link (--desktop-entry, activationRequested) still waits for the lists
  (navigateToComponent is emitted at the end of loadSources, as before for the first load).
- After numbers: pending, manager will measure.

Not built yet; uncertain: save()/defaults() before loadSources() has run (they iterate empty lists, which should be harmless);
the blocking KGlobalAccel call is only moved, not made async (no async variant confirmed in this tree); the SourcesPage list
is still one big ListView (not sliced).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
